      "message": "I discussed this with Bao offline, and I think the following steps yield in the error message above (Bao please correct me if I am wrong)\n\n```\n$ m installclean \u0026\u0026 m \u0026\u0026 vendor/google/tools/flashall -w\n$ adb shell ls /apex/com.android.hardware.audio/\n# no match\n```\n\nI believe `adb install` should make the tests pass\n```\n$ m installclean \u0026\u0026 m \u0026\u0026 vendor/google/tools/flashall -w\n$ adb install $PRODUCT_OUT/vendor/apex/com.android.hardware.audio.apex \u0026\u0026 adb reboot\n$ adb shell ls /apex/com.android.hardware.audio/\n# match found\n\n```\n\n@jooyung@google.com Could I please know if adb install is the recommended approach for such testing workflows? Is it possible to use go/flash instead?",
